stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> DETECTED: evaluator.verdict FAIL<br/>(breached thresholds)
  DETECTED --> ROLLED_BACK: rollback.completed<br/>post_rollback_probe_ok = true
  DETECTED --> ROLLBACK_FAILED: probe not healthy
  ROLLED_BACK --> EVIDENCE_COLLECTED: evidence.collected<br/>artifact_url + SHA-256
  EVIDENCE_COLLECTED --> INVESTIGATING: flow.started / repair MR opened
  INVESTIGATING --> REPAIR_PROPOSED: repair.proposed (MR iid + fix SHA)
  INVESTIGATING --> INVESTIGATION_FAILED: no_fix_found
  REPAIR_PROPOSED --> VERIFYING: gate verdicts PASS
  REPAIR_PROPOSED --> VERIFICATION_FAILED: a gate FAILS
  VERIFYING --> MERGED: merge.completed<br/>only if PROVEN and Integrity PASS
  MERGED --> REDEPLOYING: deploy.canary_started for the fix SHA
  REDEPLOYING --> RECOVERED: evaluator PASS, fix SHA, 100% traffic
  REDEPLOYING --> REDEPLOY_UNHEALTHY: evaluator FAIL on the fix
  RECOVERED --> [*]
